

## `.gitignore` File for Pilang Project

```gitignore
# Compiled object files
*.o
#*.obj

# Compiled Dynamic libraries
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll
*.txt

# Compiled Static libraries
*.lib
*.a


# compressed files
*.rar

# Executables
*.exe
*.out
*.wasm

# web files
*.js
!utils/js/*.js
*.html


# Debug files
*.log
*.tmp

 
#log files
*.log

# Build directories
build/
bin/
third_party/
emsdk/
release/
# utils/
# micrograd/
# editors/
website/
# ML/


# Emscripten cache
.cache/
emscripten_cache/

# IDE-specific files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.code-workspace





#site

website/
#formatter and minifiers
# JS/


# macOS
.DS_Store

# Windows
Thumbs.db


vids/

# test.pi
main.pi
dt_vm.c

# Ignore Python bytecode and cache recursively
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Local agent instructions
AGENTS.md

# Checked-in Windows static build kit. It lets `make release` produce a
# self-contained runtime without rebuilding SDL on every machine.
!resources/windows-x64-static/
!resources/windows-x64-static/include/
!resources/windows-x64-static/include/**
!resources/windows-x64-static/lib/
!resources/windows-x64-static/lib/**

Don't Touch My Presents/
Flappy Bird/
